@startuml "Validation réussie d'un billet"

title Processus de validation réussie et mise à jour des données

actor "Contrôleur\n(Staff événement)" as Controller
participant "App Mobile\n(Scan QR)" as MobileApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Ticket Controller" as TicketCtrl
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Analytics Service" as AnalyticsSvc
participant "Notification Service" as NotifSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis

== Validation réussie du billet ==
TicketSvc -> TicketSvc: Vérifier toutes les conditions
note right: - Billet existe\n- Événement correct\n- Status = 'paid'\n- Non utilisé\n- Dans les dates

TicketSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET status='used', usedAt=NOW(), validatedBy=?
TicketSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO ticket_validations (ticketId, eventId, validatedBy, validatedAt, device_info)
TicketSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

TicketSvc -> Redis: SET used_ticket:{ticketId} = true (expire 24h)
note right: Cache pour éviter double validation

== Mise à jour des statistiques ==
TicketSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: recordTicketValidation(eventId, ticketId)
AnalyticsSvc -> Redis: INCR event:{eventId}:validated_tickets
AnalyticsSvc -> Redis: INCR event:{eventId}:hourly_validations:{hour}

== Réponse de validation ==
TicketSvc --> TicketCtrl: validation success
TicketCtrl --> API: {status: 'valid', participant: {name, ticketType}}
API --> MobileApp: validation success
MobileApp --> Controller: ✅ "ACCÈS AUTORISÉ\nNom: John Doe\nType: VIP"

== Notification optionnelle ==
TicketCtrl -> NotifSvc: notifyTicketUsed(userId, eventId)
NotifSvc -> NotifSvc: Send push notification (optional)

@enduml